WEBVTT

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.310
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.310
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:59.320 --> 01:04.500
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:59.320 --> 01:04.500
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

01:04.660 --> 01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

01:04.660 --> 01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.670
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.670
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

01:13.840 --> 01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

01:13.840 --> 01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

01:42.370 --> 01:50.580
A FATHER AND SON CLASH

01:51.130 --> 01:53.230
<i>I won't give in!</i>

01:53.230 --> 01:55.130
<i>I'm me!</i>

01:55.760 --> 01:57.970
<i>I'm Dai, the Hero!</i>

02:00.430 --> 02:05.490
You still resist your father?! You fool!

02:05.490 --> 02:07.180
You're not...

02:07.430 --> 02:08.980
You're not...

02:10.020 --> 02:12.520
You're not my dad!

02:21.120 --> 02:22.630
<i>What?!</i>

02:22.630 --> 02:26.910
<i>He struck me while I was shielded
by my Draconic Aura?!</i>

02:31.040 --> 02:31.830
What?!

02:36.960 --> 02:39.720
Dai's crest is on his fist?!

02:40.090 --> 02:43.260
<i>What?! Impossible! This can't be!</i>

02:43.760 --> 02:47.490
<i>In thousands of years
of Dragon Knight history</i>

02:47.490 --> 02:52.120
<i>for the light of the crest to appear
anywhere other than the forehead...</i>

02:52.120 --> 02:54.610
<i>It's never happened before!</i>

02:55.690 --> 02:56.690
<i>Could it be...?!</i>

02:57.820 --> 02:59.860
<i>The human spirit?!</i>

03:00.070 --> 03:03.200
<i>Is this Soala's will?!</i>

03:10.750 --> 03:12.210
Dai...

03:12.540 --> 03:18.730
W-What's going on?!
Why is the Dragon Crest on his fist?!

03:18.730 --> 03:22.990
I think Dai did it by his own will.

03:22.990 --> 03:24.030
What?!

03:24.030 --> 03:26.930
To escape Baran's mind control...

03:27.510 --> 03:30.040
and to gain greater power than him...

03:30.040 --> 03:35.980
he realized he had to move
the power of his crest from his forehead.

03:36.570 --> 03:41.340
His full Aura power may be weaker,
but when it's focused in a single point,

03:41.340 --> 03:43.990
each attack is stronger!

03:46.370 --> 03:49.550
Is such a miracle possible?!

03:49.550 --> 03:53.930
I doubt a normal Dragon Knight can do it.

03:53.930 --> 03:56.710
Even Baran seems taken aback.

03:56.710 --> 04:00.260
Prepare yourself, Baran!

04:01.220 --> 04:02.400
What?!

04:02.400 --> 04:05.390
You've taken so much from me!

04:05.680 --> 04:06.720
My...

04:07.300 --> 04:10.140
My dearest things!

04:10.470 --> 04:15.440
Even if you are my dad,
I'll never forgive you!

04:16.400 --> 04:18.770
I'm going to crush you!

04:32.870 --> 04:36.670
Watch your tongue, boy!

05:01.230 --> 05:02.400
Amazing!

05:02.820 --> 05:05.050
I'm speculating, but...

05:05.050 --> 05:10.830
I think the blood of Dai's human half
brought on this miracle.

05:11.580 --> 05:15.220
His feelings for his friend
ignited a fire in his human heart,

05:15.220 --> 05:18.290
driving the Dragon
and Darkling powers into his fist.

05:18.630 --> 05:21.590
And this gave Dai control of his power!

05:26.550 --> 05:28.810
You mean right now, Dai is...?!

05:28.810 --> 05:35.310
He should have full control
over the power of the Dragon Crest.

05:39.860 --> 05:41.120
<i>Soala...</i>

05:41.120 --> 05:46.740
<i>Even you... Are you saying I was wrong?</i>

05:47.110 --> 05:48.160
Curse you!

05:55.790 --> 05:57.830
Draconic Aura!

06:26.690 --> 06:28.000
Impossible!

06:28.000 --> 06:33.780
Yes! You're right!
Every one of Dai's attacks is stronger!

06:35.160 --> 06:36.500
But...

06:46.960 --> 06:51.300
This is ridiculous!
As if a child could beat his father!

06:52.300 --> 06:56.600
It's time to back down
or I'll open a hole in your body!

06:57.560 --> 07:02.770
If I fire my Crest Beam at full power,
it can carve a mountain!

07:03.730 --> 07:05.610
So what if it can?!

07:06.190 --> 07:08.940
Are you sure, Dino?!

07:10.070 --> 07:11.280
My name...

07:11.570 --> 07:13.530
My name is Dai!

07:17.160 --> 07:18.450
Take this!

07:33.970 --> 07:35.800
Your Majesty, what was that?!

07:36.260 --> 07:38.520
The Dragon Knights.

07:41.350 --> 07:42.690
Stop holding back.

07:44.440 --> 07:45.730
What?!

07:46.360 --> 07:48.280
The others are fair game...

07:49.280 --> 07:51.740
but I'm not?!

07:53.910 --> 07:58.950
Don't get cocky, you little brat!

07:59.490 --> 08:03.230
<i>No, Dai! Don't anger Baran any further!</i>

08:03.230 --> 08:07.130
<i>He hasn't shown his full power yet!</i>

08:08.130 --> 08:09.840
Amazing, Dai...

08:10.420 --> 08:12.340
We might have a chance.

08:13.680 --> 08:14.800
Merle!

08:16.300 --> 08:18.570
Princess Leona, let me cast Heal.

08:18.570 --> 08:21.640
Forget me. See to Crocodine and Hyunckel.

08:21.850 --> 08:24.020
Okay. But... Um...

08:24.770 --> 08:26.870
Leave Popp to me.

08:26.870 --> 08:28.210
Huh?

08:28.210 --> 08:33.490
I've never used it before,
but I want to test a spell on him.

08:45.920 --> 08:47.310
It-It's beginning!

08:47.310 --> 08:51.710
The greatest battle in the world
beyond anything we can fathom!

09:17.110 --> 09:18.510
They're gone!

09:18.510 --> 09:19.450
Up there!

10:13.130 --> 10:14.310
Did he do it?!

10:14.310 --> 10:15.710
No! Look out!

10:16.340 --> 10:17.420
It's over!

10:23.350 --> 10:25.810
Don't mock me!

10:47.410 --> 10:48.520
Your Majesty!

10:48.520 --> 10:53.480
Amazing. So this is
the ferocity of Dragon Knights.

10:53.480 --> 10:55.090
Will we be okay?

10:55.420 --> 10:57.770
We must make a decision.

10:57.770 --> 10:58.510
Huh?

10:59.380 --> 11:03.090
Which Dragon Knight we believe is right.

11:16.360 --> 11:17.840
Dai?!

11:17.840 --> 11:22.070
I was right. Dai's doomed at this rate!

11:22.280 --> 11:23.970
What do you mean?!

11:23.970 --> 11:29.290
Until now, Baran's been holding back
so as not to kill Dai.

11:29.620 --> 11:34.350
Even with us, he probably held back
because we used to be allies.

11:34.350 --> 11:38.920
But now he's a Dragonoid,
a Killing Demon Beast!

11:39.130 --> 11:43.930
If provoked enough,
he'll kill anyone, no matter who they are!

11:44.390 --> 11:45.350
You mean...?!

11:46.010 --> 11:49.270
Even if it's his own son!

11:56.980 --> 11:58.570
Burn away!

11:59.400 --> 12:01.610
Along with this country!

12:05.820 --> 12:06.890
No!

12:06.890 --> 12:08.490
That's Doruora?!

12:18.960 --> 12:21.550
AVAN STRASH

12:23.930 --> 12:26.550
GIGABREAK

12:31.060 --> 12:32.450
Baran's hands...

12:32.450 --> 12:34.140
It's a Dragon's mouth!

12:34.980 --> 12:36.620
What energy!

12:36.620 --> 12:41.710
I get it! Doruora compresses
massive amounts of Draconic Aura

12:41.710 --> 12:43.700
and fires it as a spell!

12:44.400 --> 12:45.990
Take this!

12:46.610 --> 12:49.410
Look out! Dai, dodge it!

12:53.580 --> 12:54.910
I won't let you!

12:55.210 --> 12:57.130
Doruora!

13:16.310 --> 13:21.730
What power!
This isn't even a spell anymore!

13:22.650 --> 13:23.900
Where's Dai?!

13:24.780 --> 13:26.610
Did he get him?!

13:46.590 --> 13:49.900
I see. You dodged with a Zoom spell.

13:49.900 --> 13:51.680
You have good instincts.

13:52.220 --> 13:56.480
He escaped the Doruora energy field
with a sudden short Zoom spell!

13:58.940 --> 14:00.860
I won't miss a second time!

14:07.200 --> 14:08.320
Levizoom!

14:09.860 --> 14:14.700
Dai, you can't beat Baran in the air!
He has wings!

14:19.040 --> 14:21.270
Why is he choosing to fly?

14:21.270 --> 14:22.730
Because of us.

14:22.730 --> 14:23.440
Huh?!

14:23.440 --> 14:26.610
If Baran fires that Super Spell down here,

14:26.610 --> 14:29.510
we and the people of Teran
will be reduced to ash!

14:29.930 --> 14:32.410
That's why Dai took to the sky!

14:32.410 --> 14:33.240
But...!

14:33.240 --> 14:38.560
Even in his anger,
Dai is still our Dai inside.

14:39.640 --> 14:42.230
He's not a monster like Baran!

14:43.360 --> 14:44.440
Dai!

14:44.860 --> 14:46.780
Hurry and heal us!

14:47.530 --> 14:50.830
All I need is to stand!
I can't just do nothing!

14:50.830 --> 14:51.780
Okay!

14:53.740 --> 14:56.200
I see you've given up.

14:57.500 --> 14:59.460
This will end it!

15:13.680 --> 15:16.720
What do you think you're doing?!

15:17.930 --> 15:19.680
I'll withstand it!

15:21.350 --> 15:26.520
Even you can't cast a spell
that strong more than twice!

15:27.110 --> 15:29.670
If I withstand this...

15:29.670 --> 15:31.110
I'll win!

15:32.610 --> 15:33.990
What?!

15:33.990 --> 15:35.490
That's crazy, Dai!

15:35.870 --> 15:37.460
You fool!

15:37.460 --> 15:43.750
No being can withstand
a Dragon Knight's Doruora at full power!

15:44.710 --> 15:47.420
It's never been used on a Dragon Knight!

15:48.130 --> 15:51.340
I'm a Dragon Knight, too!

15:52.380 --> 15:55.180
Save your nonsense, boy!

15:55.180 --> 15:57.240
Dai, dodge it!

15:57.240 --> 15:59.850
It's too late for that!

16:01.060 --> 16:03.120
Take this and begone!

16:03.120 --> 16:05.690
Doruora!

16:08.820 --> 16:11.740
Dragon within me,
now's the time to awaken!

16:12.200 --> 16:14.910
Focus everything I have to defeat him!

16:15.320 --> 16:17.700
Draconic Aura!

16:35.220 --> 16:36.470
Dai?!

16:36.800 --> 16:37.760
Dai!

16:49.440 --> 16:51.150
There's nothing left!

16:54.950 --> 16:56.280
What's so funny?!

16:57.570 --> 16:58.570
You monster!

17:12.380 --> 17:15.470
H-He withstood it! That Super Spell!

17:16.590 --> 17:17.740
Impossible!

17:17.740 --> 17:18.890
Baran!

17:19.220 --> 17:21.810
You've got nothing left now!

17:28.690 --> 17:30.400
Take this!

17:32.110 --> 17:34.360
Avan...

17:35.280 --> 17:36.900
Strash!

17:48.750 --> 17:50.790
Leona's knife?!

17:57.800 --> 17:59.570
What a pity.

17:59.570 --> 18:03.810
When Dragon Knights fight
with Draconic Auras at full strength,

18:04.390 --> 18:09.500
normal weapons and armour
can't endure the power and burn up!

18:09.500 --> 18:13.840
In your case, you've focused
all of your power in your right arm.

18:13.840 --> 18:18.760
No weapon in the world
can endure such immense power!

18:18.760 --> 18:20.130
No!

18:20.130 --> 18:21.200
But...

18:21.910 --> 18:23.200
this!

18:25.120 --> 18:27.750
My Demon Dragon Blade is different!

18:28.370 --> 18:32.670
This is the only sword in the world
that can endure the Draconic Aura!

18:33.750 --> 18:35.060
Dammit!

18:35.060 --> 18:40.550
Only this sword can endure
a full-powered swing of a Dragon Knight!

18:41.180 --> 18:46.350
I may not have the Magic Power to cast
Doruora, but victory is in sight!

18:47.100 --> 18:49.190
I'll slice you in two!

18:53.310 --> 18:54.330
You?!

18:54.330 --> 18:57.190
I won't let you!

18:59.650 --> 19:04.620
I was known as the Beast King!
I don't intend to just lie around!

19:10.370 --> 19:12.790
Hang in there, everybody!

19:15.090 --> 19:18.340
I'll see to Popp!

19:21.470 --> 19:23.720
His heart's stopped.

19:24.640 --> 19:28.560
<i>I don't know if I can cast
such a major spell.</i>

19:28.930 --> 19:33.270
<i>But if I don't succeed, Popp will...</i>

19:34.980 --> 19:36.730
Gods, bless us.

19:37.320 --> 19:44.160
In thy name, let the soul of this one
whose life has burned out be restored!

19:52.790 --> 19:53.750
That spell...!

19:56.840 --> 19:57.590
Zing!

20:01.380 --> 20:06.280
It's Zing! The resurrection spell
said to bring back the dead!

20:06.280 --> 20:08.060
Then Popp can be saved?!

20:08.850 --> 20:10.280
I don't know.

20:10.280 --> 20:15.580
Even with an experienced Cleric,
the success rate is less than 50 percent.

20:15.580 --> 20:18.320
So it's up to the Princess's magic level.

20:19.280 --> 20:22.070
Come back to us, Popp!

20:27.330 --> 20:31.540
If you want to cut my arm
you'll have to use Gigabreak!

20:32.040 --> 20:32.910
Curse you!

20:39.210 --> 20:40.590
A Zapple spell?!

20:42.380 --> 20:44.550
Crocodine!

20:46.510 --> 20:49.890
Fool! Die quietly
like the bag of bones you are!

20:50.510 --> 20:55.140
Not even the gods can interfere
in this battle between father and son!

20:56.060 --> 20:58.940
Prepare yourself, Dai!

21:31.350 --> 21:32.680
I'm not finished!

21:32.890 --> 21:36.480
I can't just sit around.
If I can move, it's enough.

21:38.020 --> 21:40.480
Crocodine, wake up! Get up!

21:41.520 --> 21:42.790
Hyunckel.

21:42.790 --> 21:44.400
We have to help Dai.

21:44.610 --> 21:48.090
Lend me your strength. I have a plan.

21:48.090 --> 21:49.410
What?!

22:04.380 --> 22:07.300
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

22:04.380 --> 22:07.300
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

22:07.470 --> 22:11.260
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

22:07.470 --> 22:11.260
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

22:11.430 --> 22:15.350
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

22:11.430 --> 22:15.350
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

22:15.520 --> 22:19.400
<i>How far will we go?</i>

22:15.520 --> 22:19.400
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

22:19.560 --> 22:22.690
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

22:19.560 --> 22:22.690
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

22:22.860 --> 22:26.610
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

22:22.860 --> 22:26.610
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

22:26.780 --> 22:30.320
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

22:26.780 --> 22:30.320
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

22:30.490 --> 22:34.660
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

22:30.490 --> 22:34.660
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

22:36.370 --> 22:38.660
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

22:36.370 --> 22:38.660
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

22:40.210 --> 22:42.460
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

22:40.210 --> 22:42.460
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

22:44.050 --> 22:48.090
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

22:44.050 --> 22:48.090
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

22:48.630 --> 22:53.640
<i>That single little promise</i>

22:48.630 --> 22:53.640
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

22:53.800 --> 22:57.430
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

22:53.800 --> 22:57.430
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

22:57.600 --> 22:59.730
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

22:57.600 --> 22:59.730
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

22:59.890 --> 23:03.900
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

22:59.890 --> 23:03.900
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

23:04.070 --> 23:08.400
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

23:04.070 --> 23:08.400
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

23:08.570 --> 23:11.570
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

23:08.570 --> 23:11.570
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

23:11.740 --> 23:16.240
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

23:11.740 --> 23:16.240
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

23:16.410 --> 23:22.460
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

23:16.410 --> 23:22.460
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

23:34.050 --> 23:39.020
<i>Dai is on the defense, but thanks to
backup from Hyunckel, he holds out.</i>

23:39.180 --> 23:43.560
<i>Meanwhile, Leona continues
to desperately cast Zing on Popp.</i>

23:44.270 --> 23:46.270
<i>The battle's conclusion approaches.</i>

23:46.440 --> 23:49.110
<i>Will Dai be able
to defeat his father Baran?</i>

23:49.740 --> 23:52.660
<i>Lightning shall sever
the ties of father and son.</i>

23:53.240 --> 23:55.620
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

23:55.780 --> 23:57.330
<i>"Farewell to the Father"</i>

23:57.490 --> 23:59.500
<i>The adventure continues!</i>

23:59.500 --> 24:01.500


24:01.500 --> 24:03.480

